OL,3,AUS offers $20m reward for information
OL,4,Aabout Iran's nuclear programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has announced a reward of up to
OL,7,F$20 million for information about
OL,8,FIran's nuclear programme.
OL,10,FThe State Department's Rewards for
OL,11,FJustice is also offering to potentially
OL,12,Frelocate the person who provides such
OL,13,Fdetails.
OL,15,FPresident Donald Trump claimed last
OL,16,Fyear that Iran's nuclear facilities had
OL,17,Fbeen "completely and totally
OL,18,Fobliterated" following a bombing
OL,19,Fcampaign by the US and Israel.
