OL,3,AUS offers $20m reward for information
OL,4,Aabout Iran's nuclear programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran insists its nuclear programme is
OL,7,Fpeaceful and that it has no intention
OL,8,Fof developing a nuclear weapon.
